[{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1226:b004:l019","ordinal":169729,"en":"Nothing caught the eye,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1226:b004:l020","ordinal":169730,"en":"And one could not tell which road it was."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1226:b004:l021","ordinal":169731,"en":"Toltoi's sight was bound:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1226:b004:l022","ordinal":169732,"en":"Aichürök, daughter of the hero,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1226:b004:l023","ordinal":169733,"en":"Recited words in Arabic"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1226:b004:l024","ordinal":169734,"en":"And cast a ground fog;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1226:b004:l025","ordinal":169735,"en":"Thus that road"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1226:b004:l026","ordinal":169736,"en":"Vanished entirely from sight."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1226:b004:l027","ordinal":169737,"en":"Clouds formed in the hollows,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1226:b004:l028","ordinal":169738,"en":"And ground fog descended and closed in;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1226:b004:l029","ordinal":169739,"en":"The accursed woman Aichürök's"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1226:b004:l030","ordinal":169740,"en":"Weather-working power appeared."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1226:b004:l031","ordinal":169741,"en":"Fine rain separated through the air,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1226:b004:l032","ordinal":169742,"en":"And cloud covered the moon;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1226:b004:l033","ordinal":169743,"en":"Toltoi of the Zhediger"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1226:b004:l034","ordinal":169744,"en":"Lost his wits."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1226:b004:l035","ordinal":169745,"en":"Then Toltoi grew excited"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1226:b004:l036","ordinal":169746,"en":"And spoke to himself:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1226:b004:l037","ordinal":169747,"en":"\"Before these benighted eyes,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1226:b004:l038","ordinal":169748,"en":"Everything looks dark."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1226:b004:l039","ordinal":169749,"en":"From fording too much water at night,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b003:l001","ordinal":169750,"en":"Has God struck my eyes?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b003:l002","ordinal":169751,"en":"Before these benighted eyes,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b003:l003","ordinal":169752,"en":"Everything appears black."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b003:l004","ordinal":169753,"en":"From fording water in the darkness,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b003:l005","ordinal":169754,"en":"It seems the water has risen into my eyes."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b003:l006","ordinal":169755,"en":"What can this be?\" he said,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b003:l007","ordinal":169756,"en":"And quickly dismounted."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b003:l008","ordinal":169757,"en":"Along the single horse-track"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b003:l009","ordinal":169758,"en":"He reached down and felt with his hand."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b003:l010","ordinal":169759,"en":"A track met his hand;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b003:l011","ordinal":169760,"en":"The places struck by the hooves"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b003:l012","ordinal":169761,"en":"Were hollowed like a ravine,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b003:l013","ordinal":169762,"en":"Carved as deep as an irrigation ditch."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b003:l014","ordinal":169763,"en":"Had a giant walked"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b003:l015","ordinal":169764,"en":"Upon this desolate road?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b003:l016","ordinal":169765,"en":"Had those pursuing reached it?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b003:l017","ordinal":169766,"en":"Or had a monster"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b003:l018","ordinal":169767,"en":"Passed along this road?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b003:l019","ordinal":169768,"en":"Had those who were coming truly arrived,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b003:l020","ordinal":169769,"en":"And had my appointed death come?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b003:l021","ordinal":169770,"en":"Drinking vodka, he grew excited;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b003:l022","ordinal":169771,"en":"Hero Toltoi, heated with drink,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b003:l023","ordinal":169772,"en":"Spoke without knowing he would die."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b003:l024","ordinal":169773,"en":"Dear Toltoi the leopard"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b003:l025","ordinal":169774,"en":"Roared in his anger"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b003:l026","ordinal":169775,"en":"And thundered with courage:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b003:l027","ordinal":169776,"en":"\"If they call me a hero, a hero I am;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b003:l028","ordinal":169777,"en":"If a teeming great enemy appears,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b003:l029","ordinal":169778,"en":"I shall enter alone and test them."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b003:l030","ordinal":169779,"en":"I gird my accomplished waist;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b003:l031","ordinal":169780,"en":"If an army of seven myriads comes,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b003:l032","ordinal":169781,"en":"I shall enter alone and attack."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b003:l033","ordinal":169782,"en":"While this head remains,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b003:l034","ordinal":169783,"en":"If Akun has an enemy,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b003:l035","ordinal":169784,"en":"I shall do all I know;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b003:l036","ordinal":169785,"en":"His army too great for the earth to bear"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b003:l037","ordinal":169786,"en":"I alone shall slaughter."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b003:l038","ordinal":169787,"en":"If it is an enemy from Beijing,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b003:l039","ordinal":169788,"en":"If it brings grievous peril,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b005:l001","ordinal":169789,"en":"I shall drive it as far as Beijing;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b005:l002","ordinal":169790,"en":"If it is a Muslim army,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b005:l003","ordinal":169791,"en":"I shall drive it as far as Mecca."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b005:l004","ordinal":169792,"en":"While this fortunate head remains,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b005:l005","ordinal":169793,"en":"I shall smash its fortress walls"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b005:l006","ordinal":169794,"en":"And drive it away completely."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b005:l007","ordinal":169795,"en":"If Akun proves honest,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b005:l008","ordinal":169796,"en":"I shall give gold by the foot"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b005:l009","ordinal":169797,"en":"And try meeting him in friendship."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b005:l010","ordinal":169798,"en":"If Akun proves treacherous,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b005:l011","ordinal":169799,"en":"I shall drive and crush him"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b005:l012","ordinal":169800,"en":"And divide his village in two."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b005:l013","ordinal":169801,"en":"If he does not submit to my words,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b005:l014","ordinal":169802,"en":"If he does not give his old maid,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b005:l015","ordinal":169803,"en":"I shall smash his lattice and roof-poles,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b005:l016","ordinal":169804,"en":"Make his daughters-in-law and girls weep,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b005:l017","ordinal":169805,"en":"And crush his city-dwelling people."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b005:l018","ordinal":169806,"en":"If these Afghans distress me,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b005:l019","ordinal":169807,"en":"I shall send the Zhediger engulfing them"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b005:l020","ordinal":169808,"en":"And tread upon their heads."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b005:l021","ordinal":169809,"en":"Unless God strikes me,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b005:l022","ordinal":169810,"en":"If they call me a hero, a hero I am;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b005:l023","ordinal":169811,"en":"If an army of one myriad appears,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b005:l024","ordinal":169812,"en":"I alone shall test it."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b005:l025","ordinal":169813,"en":"Whoever resists me,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b005:l026","ordinal":169814,"en":"I shall take together with the sword;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b005:l027","ordinal":169815,"en":"If an eager enemy comes,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b005:l028","ordinal":169816,"en":"I shall put it to slaughter."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b005:l029","ordinal":169817,"en":"If an army of one myriad meets me,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b005:l030","ordinal":169818,"en":"It is my turn to bring it ruin."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b005:l031","ordinal":169819,"en":"Now is the time to put on"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b005:l032","ordinal":169820,"en":"My smooth bulletproof coat;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b005:l033","ordinal":169821,"en":"Now is the time to assail"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b005:l034","ordinal":169822,"en":"The whole world;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b005:l035","ordinal":169823,"en":"Now is the time to mount"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b005:l036","ordinal":169824,"en":"Cloud-flying Surkoyon."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b005:l037","ordinal":169825,"en":"If enemies of six ages appear,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b005:l038","ordinal":169826,"en":"If a mingled challenge arises,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1227:b005:l039","ordinal":169827,"en":"Today, without wavering,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b003:l001","ordinal":169828,"en":"It is my time to strike."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b003:l002","ordinal":169829,"en":"If he does not submit to my words,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b003:l003","ordinal":169830,"en":"If he does not give his old maid,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b003:l004","ordinal":169831,"en":"I shall bring splendid slaughter"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b003:l005","ordinal":169832,"en":"Upon accursed Akun;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b003:l006","ordinal":169833,"en":"If Azhibai and Tümönbai appear,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b003:l007","ordinal":169834,"en":"I shall take their heads.\""},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b003:l008","ordinal":169835,"en":"Drinking vodka and panting,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b003:l009","ordinal":169836,"en":"Lion Toltoi spoke thus,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b003:l010","ordinal":169837,"en":"Growing excited by himself"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b003:l011","ordinal":169838,"en":"And speaking to himself."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b003:l012","ordinal":169839,"en":"He girded his waist firmly,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b003:l013","ordinal":169840,"en":"Mounted Surkoyon,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b003:l014","ordinal":169841,"en":"And raced across the steppe."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b003:l015","ordinal":169842,"en":"Calamitous Toltoi"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b003:l016","ordinal":169843,"en":"Set out and spurred onto the road."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b003:l017","ordinal":169844,"en":"Looming like Ala-Too,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b003:l018","ordinal":169845,"en":"He raced along the road,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b003:l019","ordinal":169846,"en":"Roaring in excitement."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b003:l020","ordinal":169847,"en":"He rode a sleek horse like water,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b003:l021","ordinal":169848,"en":"Speaking to himself,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b003:l022","ordinal":169849,"en":"Settling into his wrath,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b003:l023","ordinal":169850,"en":"And girding on his unsheathed sword;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b003:l024","ordinal":169851,"en":"Like a cloud about to rain again,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b003:l025","ordinal":169852,"en":"He turned in anger."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b003:l026","ordinal":169853,"en":"Gray-wolf Toltoi's abundance"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b003:l027","ordinal":169854,"en":"Was complete,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b003:l028","ordinal":169855,"en":"But your mountainlike hero"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b003:l029","ordinal":169856,"en":"Was deficient in fortune."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b003:l030","ordinal":169857,"en":"Had his fortune been whole,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b003:l031","ordinal":169858,"en":"He would have been a mountainlike lion."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b003:l032","ordinal":169859,"en":"His right shoulder was broad;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b003:l033","ordinal":169860,"en":"He was a hero who shattered the Oirats."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b003:l034","ordinal":169861,"en":"He knew the people through wise thought,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b003:l035","ordinal":169862,"en":"And possessed command."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b003:l036","ordinal":169863,"en":"He subdued the whole world"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b003:l037","ordinal":169864,"en":"And possessed wrestling strength."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b003:l038","ordinal":169865,"en":"Hero Toltoi came onward,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b003:l039","ordinal":169866,"en":"Standing erect and untroubled;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b004:l001","ordinal":169867,"en":"The drunkard who had swallowed vodka"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b004:l002","ordinal":169868,"en":"Reckoned an enemy appearing on the road"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b004:l003","ordinal":169869,"en":"As less than the hem of his robe."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b004:l004","ordinal":169870,"en":"If an enemy appeared before him,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b004:l005","ordinal":169871,"en":"What would dear Toltoi do?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b004:l006","ordinal":169872,"en":"He looked ready to carve them with his sword;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b004:l007","ordinal":169873,"en":"If an enemy encountered him,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b004:l008","ordinal":169874,"en":"He looked ready to strike them all down"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b004:l009","ordinal":169875,"en":"And slaughter every one."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b004:l010","ordinal":169876,"en":"Surkoyon beneath him"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b004:l011","ordinal":169877,"en":"Ran beyond all bounds, leaping;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b004:l012","ordinal":169878,"en":"Hero Toltoi above him"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b004:l013","ordinal":169879,"en":"Came onward then,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b004:l014","ordinal":169880,"en":"Holding his battle-axe ready."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b004:l015","ordinal":169881,"en":"Hero Toltoi of the Zhediger"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b004:l016","ordinal":169882,"en":"Was born an accomplished khan;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b004:l017","ordinal":169883,"en":"He was the khan who gathered and ruled"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b004:l018","ordinal":169884,"en":"The Zhediger of Zheti-Özön."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b004:l019","ordinal":169885,"en":"Toltoi's heart desired"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b004:l020","ordinal":169886,"en":"To lie in Aichürök's embrace,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b004:l021","ordinal":169887,"en":"The daughter of Akun."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b004:l022","ordinal":169888,"en":"His inlaid spear with a hollow socket"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b004:l023","ordinal":169889,"en":"Came bobbing into view."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b004:l024","ordinal":169890,"en":"In his own heart then,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b004:l025","ordinal":169891,"en":"He came onward rejoicing."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b004:l026","ordinal":169892,"en":"Saying of Akun's daughter Chürök,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b004:l027","ordinal":169893,"en":"\"I shall raise her white dress"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b004:l028","ordinal":169894,"en":"And mount her white breast,\""},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b004:l029","ordinal":169895,"en":"No matter how many enemies appeared before him,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b004:l030","ordinal":169896,"en":"He intended to enter among them alone."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b004:l031","ordinal":169897,"en":"To take as a wife,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b004:l032","ordinal":169898,"en":"There was no woman but Chürök;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b004:l033","ordinal":169899,"en":"If ten thousand enemies appeared before him,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b004:l034","ordinal":169900,"en":"There was no hero but himself."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b004:l035","ordinal":169901,"en":"Drunk and rejoicing,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b004:l036","ordinal":169902,"en":"Beastly Toltoi boasted,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b004:l037","ordinal":169903,"en":"Beat the doolbas once,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b004:l038","ordinal":169904,"en":"And raced upon Surkoyon,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1228:b004:l039","ordinal":169905,"en":"His inlaid spear leveled,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1229:b003:l001","ordinal":169906,"en":"As though about to wreak destruction,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1229:b003:l002","ordinal":169907,"en":"His voice deafening the ears."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1229:b003:l003","ordinal":169908,"en":"Külchoro lay sleeping"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1229:b003:l004","ordinal":169909,"en":"As Toltoi approached;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1229:b003:l005","ordinal":169910,"en":"He stood erect and untroubled."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1229:b003:l006","ordinal":169911,"en":"Though the boy was a servant,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1229:b003:l007","ordinal":169912,"en":"Almighty God had multiplied in him"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1229:b003:l008","ordinal":169913,"en":"Heroism and leonine courage,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1229:b003:l009","ordinal":169914,"en":"Granting them without measure."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1229:b003:l010","ordinal":169915,"en":"He had no tongue with which to speak;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1229:b003:l011","ordinal":169916,"en":"Arbuudan beneath him"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1229:b003:l012","ordinal":169917,"en":"Was sibling to Algara"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1229:b003:l013","ordinal":169918,"en":"Of Maiden Saikal."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1229:b003:l014","ordinal":169919,"en":"He had raced with wild asses"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1229:b003:l015","ordinal":169920,"en":"And contended with thoroughbreds."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1229:b003:l016","ordinal":169921,"en":"Külchoro remained asleep;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1229:b003:l017","ordinal":169922,"en":"Hearing the sound, Taibuurul"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1229:b003:l018","ordinal":169923,"en":"Flattened his right ear."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1229:b003:l019","ordinal":169924,"en":"As though he had seen a wolf,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1229:b003:l020","ordinal":169925,"en":"The animal groaned"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1229:b003:l021","ordinal":169926,"en":"And flung the crust of black earth"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1229:b003:l022","ordinal":169927,"en":"Upon Külchoro."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1229:b003:l023","ordinal":169928,"en":"Still Choro did not wake;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1229:b004:l001","ordinal":169929,"en":"Snorting and choking,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1229:b004:l002","ordinal":169930,"en":"He pounded the black earth's crust"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1229:b004:l003","ordinal":169931,"en":"With his feet."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1229:b004:l004","ordinal":169932,"en":"Still Choro did not wake."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1229:b004:l005","ordinal":169933,"en":"He had begun snoring;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1229:b004:l006","ordinal":169934,"en":"Fearless Külchoro"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1229:b004:l007","ordinal":169935,"en":"Slept without stirring."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1229:b004:l008","ordinal":169936,"en":"The child-finding monster"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1229:b004:l009","ordinal":169937,"en":"Had rested his head upon a stone"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1229:b004:l010","ordinal":169938,"en":"And fallen asleep exhausted."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1229:b004:l011","ordinal":169939,"en":"Taibuurul stood alarmed, thinking,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1229:b004:l012","ordinal":169940,"en":"\"If hero Toltoi suddenly arrives,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1229:b004:l013","ordinal":169941,"en":"What will he do with his spear?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1229:b004:l014","ordinal":169942,"en":"He will put the twelve-year-old boy"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1229:b004:l015","ordinal":169943,"en":"To death.\""},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1229:b004:l016","ordinal":169944,"en":"\"Choro knows wickedness;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1229:b004:l017","ordinal":169945,"en":"At tomorrow's gathering day"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1229:b004:l018","ordinal":169946,"en":"He will ride me like a black donkey,\""},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1229:b004:l019","ordinal":169947,"en":"The horse thought, and like one seeing a wolf,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1229:b004:l020","ordinal":169948,"en":"He snorted."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1229:b004:l021","ordinal":169949,"en":"He turned his staglike neck;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1229:b004:l022","ordinal":169950,"en":"When he struck and scattered the earth,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1229:b004:l023","ordinal":169951,"en":"Still the boy did not wake."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1229:b006:l001","ordinal":169952,"en":"The earth split in a mirage;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1229:b006:l002","ordinal":169953,"en":"Toltoi of the Zhediger"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1229:b006:l003","ordinal":169954,"en":"Came drawing near."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1229:b006:l004","ordinal":169955,"en":"The matchless horse Buurul"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1229:b006:l005","ordinal":169956,"en":"Bit down upon his bit;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1229:b006:l006","ordinal":169957,"en":"The spiritlike Taibuurul"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1229:b006:l007","ordinal":169958,"en":"Spun around the spear"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1229:b006:l008","ordinal":169959,"en":"That had been thrust into the ground."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1229:b006:l009","ordinal":169960,"en":"Külchoro upon him"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1229:b006:l010","ordinal":169961,"en":"Nearly fell from Taibuurul,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1229:b006:l011","ordinal":169962,"en":"Then righted himself."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1229:b007:l001","ordinal":169963,"en":"\"Oh, oh, what is the swine doing?\""},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1229:b007:l002","ordinal":169964,"en":"The boy cried as he awoke;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1229:b007:l003","ordinal":169965,"en":"His small heart pounded,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1229:b007:l004","ordinal":169966,"en":"And all his insides and intestines"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1229:b007:l005","ordinal":169967,"en":"Heaved without stopping."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1229:b007:l006","ordinal":169968,"en":"His waist slackened and he hunched;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1229:b007:l007","ordinal":169969,"en":"The young prince Külchoro"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1229:b007:l008","ordinal":169970,"en":"Opened his eyes wide."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1229:b007:l009","ordinal":169971,"en":"Sleep scattered and fled;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1229:b007:l010","ordinal":169972,"en":"His eyes opened wide as umach,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1229:b007:l011","ordinal":169973,"en":"And his brow drew tight,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1230:b003:l001","ordinal":169974,"en":"Your measureless sultan"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1230:b003:l002","ordinal":169975,"en":"Struggled with Buurul."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1230:b003:l003","ordinal":169976,"en":"At twelve years old, Külchoro"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1230:b003:l004","ordinal":169977,"en":"Possessed perfect fortune;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1230:b003:l005","ordinal":169978,"en":"From your ocean-like Almambet"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1230:b003:l006","ordinal":169979,"en":"The warrior remained as a gift."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1230:b003:l007","ordinal":169980,"en":"Your spring flowing from a river,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1230:b003:l008","ordinal":169981,"en":"From mighty Sultan Alman"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1230:b003:l009","ordinal":169982,"en":"Your young champion remained as a gift."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1230:b003:l010","ordinal":169983,"en":"Leaning back and watching the pass,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1230:b003:l011","ordinal":169984,"en":"Your valiant hero stood looking."}]
